  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "noticeKind": "placeholder",
          "text": "原文中的动态称谓保留为占位符：|101|＝玩家昵称。",
          "type": "notice"
        }
      ],
      "id": "reading-note",
      "title": "阅读说明"
    },
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "37901001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37901002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "小奏？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37901003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "她手上怎么捧着一沓纸？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37901004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37901005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "后宅……布置得就像教室？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37901006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "为什么《格斗学园》的手办也都聚在这里？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37901007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "那么，考试开始。请大家认真答题。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37901008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37901009",
          "sourceType": 3,
          "text": "一段时间后……",
          "type": "narration"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37901010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "|101|，你来了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37901011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "你刚才在监考？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37901012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "嗯，为了帮助大家精进武道。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "37901014",
              "text": "我不太明白……"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "37901014",
              "text": "这有什么联系吗？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "37901013",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37901014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "真乃说，完成试炼可以提升武道的境界。所以，我来举行——",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37901015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "「天使的试炼」。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37901016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "「试炼」和「考试」不是一回事吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37901017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "但看起来大家挺配合的，你收到了不少卷子。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37901018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "在考试结束前想离开的都被我阻止了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "37901020",
              "text": "细想有点可怕……"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "37901020",
              "text": "原来这才是「试炼」。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "37901019",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37901020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "立华奏",
          "text": "大家都很热情呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "37901021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我去检查下后宅的家具损毁情况……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
